 "rule": "per system and N, from the ABF benchmark (medians over the 3 repeats of c_ss): CPU route = the hybrid short-T rule (P* = fastest thread count, ties within 3 % to fewer threads; P* iff median c_ss(P*) <= median c_ss(S1) / 1.05 and every P* repeat faster than every S1 repeat, else S1); then G1 iff median c_ss(G1) <= median c_ss(CPU route) / 1.05 and every G1 repeat faster than every CPU-route repeat, else the CPU route.  ABF and FR at that N run on the routed backend (common-backend primary analysis)"
